  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid higher and keep a sure winner, usually the top [♠], for trick 13 instead of cashing it early.",
    "opponent": "Revealed when it first fires; opponents can save their own top trump to take the last trick.",
    "rationale": "The last trick is the strongest-measured Streaks trigger; scaling the ×mult with the contract adds bid tension (about ×2.1 at 8 and ×2.6 at 10), and the category differs from ub-last-trick-contract-mult.",
